flowchart TD
    Sources[Context Sources] --> Adapters[Source Adapters]
    Adapters --> Envelope[Normalized Context Envelope]
    Envelope --> Policy{Policy and Egress}
    Policy --> Ledger[Ingestion Ledger and Checkpoint]
    Ledger -->|Duplicate version| Skip[Skip Processing]
    Ledger -->|New or changed| Stage[Seed Package and Raw Artifact]
    Stage --> Curator[Memory Curator]
    Curator --> Memory[Canonical Memory]
    Curator --> Proposals[Memory Proposals]
    Curator --> Routed[Routed Operational Objects]
    Memory --> Retrieval[Policy-Aware Retrieval]
    Routed --> Retrieval
    Retrieval -->|Human or local model| Local[Full Authorized Context]
    Retrieval -->|External model| External[External-Allowed Context Only]
    Curator --> Archive[Processed Source Archive]
    Ledger --> Health[Ingestion Health and Recovery]
